      "Jp" : "エリオット"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 31541,
    "GroupType" : 83,
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, thank you!\r\nYay!\r\nI'm so happy to receive this gift from you!",
        "Jp" : "あっ、ありがとうございます！！\r\nやったッ！\r\n隊長からのプレゼント、嬉しいです！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819795,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Did the captain choose this color for me?\r\nIt's really wonderful.\r\nNo, it's actually a color I've always liked!\r\nIt has become my favorite color.",
        "Jp" : "この色、隊長が選んでくださったんですよね？\r\nすごく素敵です\r\nいえ、もともと好きな色なんですけど！\r\n大好きな色になりました"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819796,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Can I think of this as proof that I have been\r\npersonally recognized as the right\r\nhand of the captain?",
        "Jp" : "あの――これ、俺が隊長の右腕として\r\n直々に認められた証だって\r\n思っていてもいいですか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819797,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When I think of that, I feel much more proud than\r\nwhen I receive any medal from the Temple—\r\nbecause, more than anything else, it\r\nencourages me for tomorrow!",
        "Jp" : "そうだと思うと、神殿から\r\nどんな勲章をもらうよりも\r\nずっと誇らしい気持ちに――\r\n何よりも、明日への励みになりますから"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819917,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—so I'm going to frame it and\r\ndisplay it for a while!\r\nIt would be a shame to use it as a rug.\r\nI'll use it properly when I'm ready!",
        "Jp" : "――ということで\r\nしばらくは額に入れて飾っておきます！\r\n敷物として使うなんて勿体ないですしね\r\n覚悟ができたらちゃんと使いますよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819919,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
